OL,3,GNEWSATwo men found guilty of child
OL,4,Aabduction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been found guilty of
OL,7,Fabducting a child, with one of them
OL,8,Falso found guilty of sexual assault.
OL,10,FBirmingham Crown Court delivered
OL,11,Fverdicts on Sadak Ali, 27, of Foxton
OL,12,FRoad, Birmingham, and Hamza Sharif, 35,
OL,13,Fof St Margaret's Road, Birmingham, on
OL,14,FFriday after a 10-day trial.
OL,16,FAli and Sharif were convicted of
OL,17,Fdetaining a child after keeping them
OL,18,Funder unlawful control and, in
OL,19,Faddition, Ali was convicted of assault
OL,20,Fby touching a child under the age of
OL,21,F13.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
